integer p, turns k^p	yes	yes	yes
any real p, turns round(A·k^p)	yes	yes	no — quantised, error ~1 turn
rational p = a/b, k perfect b-th powers	yes	yes	yes, but the chain has holes (p=3/2 keeps only squares)
per-chord triangle: α_k chosen so turn_k·α_k ≈ k^p·α	yes	yes (the return uses the inverse rotations, so the product is identity regardless of α_k)	to the lattice's angle resolution
